<title>ITALY: Italian GDP Fell 0.4 pct yr/yr in Q1 97.</title>
<headline>Italian GDP Fell 0.4 pct yr/yr in Q1 97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's gross domestic product (GDP) fell by 0.4 percent, year-on-year, in the first quarter of</p>
<p>1997, National Statistics Institute Istat said.</p>
<p> ITALIAN GDP			   Q1 1997    Q4 1996  Q1 1996</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		   -0.4	  +0.1	 +1.3</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter   -0.2	  -0.2	 +0.2</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	 347.86    348.47 (r) 349.17 (r)</p>
</text>
